  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **One Fine Day** (1 other source): A cover of the Chiffons song, listed as unreleased on any Mountain Goats album [1]\n- **Pale Green Things** (1 review): Reviewer says this version is probably their favorite Mountain Goats song ever [3]\n- **Ethiopians** (1 review): Reviewer says this is one of the few live versions of the song they know of [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **the Mountain Goats take the stage**: back after 68 archived shows (996 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [4]\n- **Genesis 19 1-2**: back after 174 archived shows (4145 days); rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n- **Cobscook Bay**: back after 80 archived shows (1404 days) [4]\n- **One Fine Day**: back after 139 archived shows (3175 days); rare: 6 archived performances [4]\n- **Going to Kansas**: rare: 12 archived performances [4]\n- **Raid on Entebbe**: back after 142 archived shows (3239 days); rare: 7 archived performances [4]\n- **Masher**: back after 62 archived shows (838 days); rare: 8 archived performances [4]\n- **Milk Song**: back after 151 archived shows (3357 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tMG2020-02-22** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 21 songs; 83 min; rated 5/5 by 2 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Carmen Cicero, No Children, almost, less than two lines into Milk Song before some more [1]\n- One song between Southwestern Territory and Narakaloka is redacted from the recording because the band required that it not be taped [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tMG2020-02-22**: taped by Anonymous + LMGBTapes; transferred by LMGBTapes; source: SBD [Engineer: Brandon Eggleston] > PCM M10 + CA-14 Omni (Healy on left stage lip) > CA UBB > PCM M10 [1]",
